{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/JUnit & AssertJ/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"b83259a7-303f-5b73-837e-aecfe60f6d6b","excerpt":"📌 JUnit이란? ✅ Java 진영에서 가장 많이 사용되는 유닛 테스트 프레임워크 ✅ Java 애플리케이션에서 유닛 테스트와 통합 테스트를 실행하는 데 사용 구성요소 JUnit 5는 다음 3가지 모듈로 구성된다. 모듈 설명 JUnit Platform 다양한 테스트 엔진을 실행할 수 있는 기반 제공 JUnit Jupiter JUnit 5의 테스트 엔진 제…","html":"<h2 id=\"-JUnit이란\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-JUnit%EC%9D%B4%EB%9E%80\" aria-label=\" JUnit이란 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 JUnit이란?</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ Java 진영에서 가장 많이 사용되는 유닛 테스트 프레임워크</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ Java 애플리케이션에서 유닛 테스트와 통합 테스트를 실행하는 데 사용</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"구성요소\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C\" aria-label=\"구성요소 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>구성요소</strong></h3>\n<p>JUnit 5는 다음 <strong>3가지 모듈</strong>로 구성된다.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>모듈</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JUnit Platform</strong></td>\n<td>다양한 테스트 엔진을 실행할 수 있는 기반 제공</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JUnit Jupiter</strong></td>\n<td>JUnit 5의 테스트 엔진 제공 (<code class=\"language-text\">@Test</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">@BeforeEach</code> 등)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>JUnit Vintage</strong></td>\n<td>JUnit 3, 4 기반의 테스트 실행 지원</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-JUnit-라이프사이클-어노테이션\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-JUnit-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%ED%94%84%EC%82%AC%EC%9D%B4%ED%81%B4-%EC%96%B4%EB%85%B8%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EC%85%98\" aria-label=\" JUnit 라이프사이클 어노테이션 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 JUnit 라이프사이클 어노테이션</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ 테스트 실행 전/후 설정 및 정리를 수행하는 메서드를 정의할 수 있게 한다.</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>어노테이션</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@BeforeEach</code></td>\n<td>각 테스트 전에 실행</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@AfterEach</code></td>\n<td>각 테스트 후에 실행</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@BeforeAll</code></td>\n<td>모든 테스트 실행 전에 1번 실행</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@AfterAll</code></td>\n<td>모든 테스트 실행 후 1번 실행</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token import\"><span class=\"token namespace\">org<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>junit<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>jupiter<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>api<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span></span><span class=\"token operator\">*</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LifecycleTest</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@BeforeAll</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">beforeAll</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"📌 모든 테스트 시작 전 (1회 실행)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@BeforeEach</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">beforeEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"🔹 개별 테스트 실행 전\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">test1</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"✅ 실행: test1\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">test2</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"✅ 실행: test2\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@AfterEach</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">afterEach</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"🔹 개별 테스트 실행 후\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@AfterAll</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">static</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">afterAll</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"📌 모든 테스트 종료 후 (1회 실행)\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"-JUnit-단언-Assertions\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-JUnit-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B8-Assertions\" aria-label=\" JUnit 단언 Assertions permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 JUnit 단언 (Assertions)</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 테스트 결과를 검증하는 다양한 Assertions를 제공</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 모두 <code class=\"language-text\">org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions</code> 클래스의 <code class=\"language-text\">static</code> 메서드로 제공</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>메서드</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">assertEquals(expected, actual)</code></td>\n<td>기대값과 실제값 비교</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">assertTrue(condition)</code></td>\n<td>조건이 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code>인지 확인</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">assertFalse(condition)</code></td>\n<td>조건이 <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>인지 확인</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">assertNotNull(object)</code></td>\n<td>객체가 <code class=\"language-text\">null</code>이 아님을 확인</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">assertThrows(Exception.class, () -> {...})</code></td>\n<td>예외 발생 여부 확인</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Assertions 예시</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">addAssertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> sum <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">2</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">Assertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">assertEquals</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>sum<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>예외 처리 Assertions 예제</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">exceptionAssertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">Assertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">assertThrows</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">ArithmeticException</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"문제점\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%AC%B8%EC%A0%9C%EC%A0%90\" aria-label=\"문제점 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>문제점</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>❌ 가독성이 떨어지는 검증</strong><br>\n<strong>❌ 메서드 체이닝을 지원하지 않아 여러 검증을 수행하기 어려움</strong><br>\n<strong>❌ 예외 검증이 제한적</strong>  </p>\n<p>AssertJ는 위와 같은 JUnit의 문제점을 해결한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-AssertJ란\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-AssertJ%EB%9E%80\" aria-label=\" AssertJ란 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 AssertJ란?</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>✅ Java에서 테스트를 작성할 때 필요한 직관적인 단언을 제공하는 라이브러리</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 테스트 코드의 가독성을 향상</strong>  </p>\n<h3 id=\"구성요소-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%84%B1%EC%9A%94%EC%86%8C-1\" aria-label=\"구성요소 1 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>구성요소</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ 여러 모듈로 구성되어 있으며, 각 모듈은 특정한 타입에 대한 단언을 제공</strong>  </p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>AssertJ Core</strong>: JDK 타입(String, Iterable, Stream, Path, File, Map 등)에 대한 단언을 제공</li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ Guava</strong>: Guava 라이브러리의 타입(Multimap, Optional 등)에 대한 단언을 제공</li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ Joda-Time</strong>: Joda-Time 라이브러리의 타입(DateTime, LocalDateTime 등)에 대한 단언을 제공</li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ Neo4j</strong>: Neo4j 데이터베이스의 타입(Path, Node, Relationship 등)에 대한 단언을 제공</li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ DB</strong>: 관계형 데이터베이스의 타입(Table, Row, Column 등)에 대한 단언을 제공</li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ Swing</strong>: Swing 사용자 인터페이스의 기능적 테스트를 위한 API를 제공  </li>\n</ul>\n<p>⭐️ <code class=\"language-text\">AssertJ Core</code>가 가장 널리 사용되며, 나머지 모듈은 특정 환경(Guava, Joda-Time, DB 등)에서 사용됨</p>\n<h3 id=\"특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"특징 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>특징</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>향상된 가독성</strong>: <code class=\"language-text\">assertThat()</code> 메서드를 중심으로 자연스러운 언어 구조를 제공</li>\n<li><strong>풍부한 단언 메서드</strong>: 문자열, 컬렉션, 예외, 파일 등 다양한 타입에 대한 단언을 지원</li>\n<li><strong>메서드 체이닝</strong>: 여러 단언을 체이닝하여 가독성 향상</li>\n<li><strong>IDE 친화적</strong>: 코드 자동 완성 기능을 통해 개발 생산성을 향상</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-AssertJ-단언-Assertions\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-AssertJ-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B8-Assertions\" aria-label=\" AssertJ 단언 Assertions permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 AssertJ 단언 (Assertions)</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"기본-단언\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B8%B0%EB%B3%B8-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B8\" aria-label=\"기본 단언 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>기본 단언</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">basicAssertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Frodo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token function\">assertThat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isEqualTo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Frodo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">startsWith</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Fro\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">endsWith</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"do\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n                    <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isEqualToIgnoringCase</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"frodo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"컬렉션-단언\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%BB%AC%EB%A0%89%EC%85%98-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B8\" aria-label=\"컬렉션 단언 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>컬렉션 단언</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">collectionAssertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token generics\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name\">String</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">></span></span> fellowship <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">List</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">of</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Frodo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Sam\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Gandalf\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token function\">assertThat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>fellowship<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">hasSize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">3</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                          <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">contains</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Frodo\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Sam\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                          <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">doesNotContain</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Sauron\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"예외-단언\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%98%88%EC%99%B8-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B8\" aria-label=\"예외 단언 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-