"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isInstanceOf</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Exception</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">hasMessageContaining</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"boom\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"객체-단언\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B0%9D%EC%B2%B4-%EB%8B%A8%EC%96%B8\" aria-label=\"객체 단언 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>객체 단언</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token class-name\">Long</span> id<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> name<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token class-name\">String</span> nickname<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Test</span>  \n<span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">fieldsAssertions</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span> member1 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">1L</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"choi\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"phillip\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span> member2 <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Member</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token keyword\">null</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"choi\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"phillip\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n  \n    <span class=\"token function\">assertThat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>member1<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">usingRecursiveComparison</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                       <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">ignoringFields</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  \n                       <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isEqualTo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>member2<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-JUnit과-AssertJ의-관계\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-JUnit%EA%B3%BC-AssertJ%EC%9D%98-%EA%B4%80%EA%B3%84\" aria-label=\" JUnit과 AssertJ의 관계 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 JUnit과 AssertJ의 관계</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>JUnit은 테스트 실행을 담당</strong> (테스트 라이프사이클 관리, <code class=\"language-text\">@Test</code> 제공)  </li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ는 직관적이고 강력한 검증을 담당</strong> (<code class=\"language-text\">assertThat()</code>으로 가독성 개선)  </li>\n<li><strong>AssertJ는 JUnit이 없으면 테스트를 실행할 수 없음</strong>  </li>\n<li><strong>JUnit만 사용하면 검증 코드가 불편하므로, AssertJ를 추가하면 가독성이 향상됨</strong>  </li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://junit.org/junit5/docs/current/user-guide\">https://junit.org/junit5/docs/current/user-guide</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://assertj.github.io/doc\">https://assertj.github.io/doc</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"JUnit & AssertJ","date":"March 06, 2025","update":"March 06, 2025","tags":["Test"],"series":"TDD 적용을 위한 이론 정리"},"fields":{"slug":"/JUnit & AssertJ/","readingTime":{"minutes":5.525}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"a128a8df-b4f8-5c72-ab99-e86fdb70e115","fields":{"slug":"/TDD 개요/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"TDD 개요"}}},{"node":{"id":"b83259a7-303f-5b73-837e-aecfe60f6d6b","fields":{"slug":"/JUnit & AssertJ/"},"front